# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. Never commit these.
#
# phaseFour/.env, phaseSix/.env and phaseSeven/.env hold real
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY / TAVILY_API_KEY values and CONFIRM_PASSWORD -- the
# password that gates every destructive action (deleting files, killing
# processes, power actions). Committing that one would not just leak a
# credential, it would defeat the confirmation gate the whole design
# rests on.
#
# The .env.example files ARE committed on purpose: they document every
# knob without carrying a value.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
*.env
!.env.example
!*.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-phase virtual environments.
#
# Each phase has its own venv by design (see CLAUDE.md). They are large,
# machine-specific, and rebuildable from requirements.txt.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal data.
#
# chroma_store/ is the persistent memory from Phase 5 -- the actual
# facts spoken to Jarvis. Personal by definition, and not useful to
# anyone else.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
chroma_store/
*/chroma_store/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Downloaded model weights.
#
# openWakeWord ships its weights separately (download_models()), Whisper
# fetches its own on first use, and Piper voices are ~60MB each. All are
# reproducible; none belong in git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*.onnx
*.tflite
*.pt
*.bin
*.gguf
models/
piper/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Audio and screen capture artifacts.
#
# Recorded turns, TTS renders and screenshots are transient. Some are
# also recordings of a real person's voice or the contents of their
# screen, which is a second reason not to publish them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*.wav
*.mp3
*.webm
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
!docs/**/*.png

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
tmp/
temp/
scratch/
